Original Statement:
------------------
SELECT 
  TPCDS.PROMOTION.P_PROMO_SK,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DATE_SK 
FROM 
  TPCDS.PROMOTION 
  INNER JOIN TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 
  ON TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DATE_SK = TPCDS.PROMOTION.P_END_DATE_SK 
WHERE 
  TPCDS.PROMOTION.P_START_DATE_SK >= 2450100 AND 
  TPCDS.PROMOTION.P_PROMO_SK <= 197


Optimized Statement:
-------------------
SELECT 
  Q1.P_PROMO_SK AS "P_PROMO_SK",
  Q2.D_DATE_SK AS "D_DATE_SK" 
FROM 
  TPCDS.PROMOTION AS Q1,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 AS Q2 
WHERE 
  (Q2.D_DATE_SK = Q1.P_END_DATE_SK) AND 
  (Q1.P_PROMO_SK <= 197) AND 
  (2450100 <= Q1.P_START_DATE_SK)

Explain level:    Explain from section

